  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our programs have been specifically designed to future-proof the interests and skills of girls and gender-fluid youth (ages of 9-14). Giving them the tools and confidence to discover who they are, follow new passions, break stereotypes and find their voice.   Mind &amp; Movement lab: Building confidence, strength, and resilience.   Community &amp; Leadership: Creating a connection between the community within our own walls and beyond.  The Makes Space: Try new things, get messy and feel empowered!</narrative>
  </description>
